<title>USA: Presidential Realty Q1 net rises.</title>
<headline>Presidential Realty Q1 net rises.</headline>
<dateline>WHITE PLAINS, N.Y. 1997-05-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>1997			1996</p>
<p> Shr			  $0.38		    $0.12</p>
<p> Net			  1,352			435</p>
<p> Revs			 3,784		    3,270</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: The company said Q1 1997 results include a gain of $472,000, or $0.13 pe share, from the sale of its Cedarbrooke property in Wichita, Kansas.</p>
<p>Full name is Presidential Realty Corp.</p>
